rcp-ndcg-vllm: vLLM serving recipes, the equivalence harness, the engine recorder and the wave runner.

This package contains no ported third-party code. It is original work, released under Apache-2.0 together with the
rcp-ndcg repository (see LICENSE). The vLLM engine it configures and talks to is a separate work, served from its
own image and covered by its own licence.
